`),$i=["You link a roleplay's lorebook entries, so that when one comes up in the story the entries it depends on come",'along. A link is a lasting fact and reads "<entry> <relation> <target>". Only these relations:',"{{relations}}","","For each entry in <entries>, pick from the targets listed under it; each target comes with its summary. Most","entries have one or two real links: what kind of thing it is (is_a), the group it belongs to (member_of), where it","is (located_in), what it leads or owns, a lasting ally or rival. An entry with none of these gets no links.","","Link only when the relation is plainly true from the entry's text and the target's summary. Naming, mentioning or","comparing a target is not a link: an encounter prompt that names three teams links to none of them. Mind the","direction: the entry itself must be what the relation says. A team is not a member_of its members' clans; a","member's own entry is member_of the team. Link to the","closest kind, group or place only: an entry that is_a Ninjutsu gets no is_a Jutsu as well. Something that belongs","to someone (a bloodline, a weapon) gets no link to its owner; the owner's own entry links to it with owns. At most","3 links per entry. The entry's existing links are listed; don't repeat them. When no relation above fits exactly,","leave the link out."].join(`
